tead. [%cal Bc5c4] }) (14. h4 { Also playable. Your h pawn advances instead. } 14... c4 { Also playable, but the b4 lever is still the move asking his c5 pawn the real question. [%cal Bc5c4] }) 14... c4 { His pawn locks the structure rather than let it open. } 15. Qg1 { Your queen steps aside, and his b pawn stands with no pawn left that can ever defend it. [%cal Gf2g1] } 1-0
